      <div type="clause" n="24">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 24</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And gif he sý mægleas, ladige mid geferan, oððe fæste to corsnǽde ⁊ þaræt gefare þæt þæt God ræde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if he has no kin, he shall clear himself with the help of his fellow-ecclesiastics, or fast in preparation for the ordeal of consecrated bread, and experience there what God shall decree.</ab>
      </div>
